OL,3,GNEWSAWidespread concern about spread of
OL,4,AAsian hornets
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being urged to report
OL,7,Fsightings of Asian hornets in a bid to
OL,8,Fstop them spreading.
OL,10,FThe non-native invasive species, which
OL,11,Fwas recently spotted in Somerset for
OL,12,Fthe first time, is a predator of other
OL,13,Finsects including honeybees,
OL,14,Fbutterflies and beetles.
OL,16,FThe sighting in Somerset has raised
OL,17,Fconcerns the hornets could be heading
OL,18,Ftowards Devon and Cornwall and South
OL,19,FWest Water has asked people to report
OL,20,Fany sightings.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
