OL,3,GNEWSAWidespread concern about spread of
OL,4,AAsian hornets
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficials in the Channel Islands
OL,7,Freported a record number of Asian
OL,8,Fhornet queens and nests last year and
OL,9,Fsaid this year would be a critical
OL,10,Findicator since queens had been caught
OL,11,Fearlier than ever before.
